{"id": "UgxFslngQVymuZjkJnl4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 0, "text": "북방민족은 동이족입니다\n동이족의 조상은\n흉노족입니다", "published": "2026-08-04T06:00:03", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
